This Go implementation is derived from the consumed Unicode str regular
expression parser, compiler and matching semantics in CPython v3.12.13:
Lib/re/{__init__,_parser,_compiler,_constants,_casefix}.py and
Modules/_sre/{sre.c,sre.h,sre_lib.h,sre_constants.h,sre_targets.h}.

